  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Negativa:** to be + **not** → *I'm not · you aren't · he isn't · she isn't · it isn't · we aren't · they aren't*.",
      "",
      "**Pregunta:** se invierte el orden → *Are you…? Is she…? Are they…?*",
      "",
      "**Respuestas cortas:** *Yes, I am. / No, I'm not. · Yes, he is. / No, he isn't. · Yes, we are. / No, we aren't.*",
      "",
      "En la respuesta corta **afirmativa no se contrae**: *Yes, I am* (no *Yes, I'm*)."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "Yes, I'm.",
        "right": "Yes, I am.",
        "note": "En respuestas cortas afirmativas no se contrae."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "You are Spanish? (por escrito)",
        "right": "Are you Spanish?",
        "note": "En preguntas se invierte: verbo antes del sujeto."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
